{
  "sn36.21:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 36.21 ",
  "sn36.21:0.2": "3. Aṭṭhasatapariyāyavagga ",
  "sn36.21:0.3": "Sīvakasutta ",
  "sn36.21:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā rājagahe viharati veḷuvane kalandakanivāpe. ",
  "sn36.21:1.2": "Atha kho moḷiyasīvako paribbājako yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā saddhiṁ sammodi. ",
  "sn36.21:1.3": "Sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho moḷiyasīvako paribbājako bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn36.21:1.4": "“santi, bho gotama, eke samaṇabrāhmaṇā evaṁvādino evaṁdiṭṭhino: ",
  "sn36.21:1.5": "‘yaṁ kiñcāyaṁ purisapuggalo paṭisaṁvedeti sukhaṁ vā dukkhaṁ vā adukkhamasukhaṁ vā sabbaṁ taṁ pubbekatahetū’ti. ",
  "sn36.21:1.6": "Idha bhavaṁ gotamo kimāhā”ti? ",
  "sn36.21:2.1": "“Pittasamuṭṭhānānipi kho, sīvaka, idhekaccāni vedayitāni uppajjanti. ",
  "sn36.21:2.2": "Sāmampi kho etaṁ, sīvaka, veditabbaṁ yathā pittasamuṭṭhānānipi idhekaccāni vedayitāni uppajjanti. ",
  "sn36.21:2.3": "Lokassapi kho etaṁ, sīvaka, saccasammataṁ yathā pittasamuṭṭhānānipi idhekaccāni vedayitāni uppajjanti. ",
  "sn36.21:2.4": "Tatra, sīvaka, ye te samaṇabrāhmaṇā evaṁvādino evaṁdiṭṭhino: ",
  "sn36.21:2.5": "‘yaṁ kiñcāyaṁ purisapuggalo paṭisaṁvedeti sukhaṁ vā dukkhaṁ vā adukkhamasukhaṁ vā sabbaṁ taṁ pubbekatahetū’ti. ",
  "sn36.21:2.6": "Yañca sāmaṁ ñātaṁ 